<title>INDIA: India's Essar Oil net up 15 pct.</title>
<headline>India's Essar Oil net up 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	     (in millions of rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Gross profit	    685.8   vs    535.5</p>
<p>    Net profit		424.6   vs    368.9</p>
<p>    Net sales	     2,112.8   vs  2,807.7</p>
<p>    Total expenditure   2,368.9   vs  2,377.6</p>
<p>    Other income	  1,146.9   vs    262.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    198.2   vs    166.6</p>
<p>    Tax			  63.0	     0.0</p>
<p>Note: Essar Oil Ltd said in statement that it had recommended a dividend of 10 percent. It stated that the company had sold two of its offshore rigs for 1.9 bilion rupees.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91 22 265 9000</p>
</text>
